th instance - wise semantic segmentation labels .Our FSS - 1 0 0 0 consists of 1, 0 0 0 object classes , wherein each class we label 1 0 images with binary segmentation annotation .We are particularly interested in segmentation due to its obvious benefits : segmentation captures the essential feature of an object without background ; instance level segmentation can be ready from segmentation .But none of these few - shot learning datasets incorporate dense pixelwise segmentation labels , which is essential in training a deep network model for semantic segmentation .Few
